{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Illiceru","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/illiceru.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/illiceru.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Illiceru","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":180,"temp":0,"max":180,"details":""},"ac":{"value":30,"details":"(32 when targeting tentacles)"},"allSaves":{"value":"+2 to Reflex when targeting tentacles"},"speed":{"value":35,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"climb","value":20}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"visual","exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common"],"details":""},"level":{"value":11},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Illiceru are nightmarish creatures that are permanently invisible except for the ends of their two tentacles, which are nearly perfect duplications of humans. They puppet these tentacles as they stalk villages and cities, standing above crowds and climbing on buildings with their spider-like legs. Each of an illiceru's tentacles can speak, and they use this ability to talk to their prey. They convince people to leave town or follow them to alleys, where the illiceru can swallow them without drawing attention.</p>\n<p>While an illiceru's tentacles are almost perfect imitations, they can be spotted by a notably trained or particularly paranoid individual. Each illiceru has two tentacles. They often take the appearance of one man and one woman, and they usually act as husband and wife. Their eyes are fake, so they commonly don't make eye contact. When an illiceru is known to be in the area, people tend to be wary of any pair of strangers. In extreme cases, suspicious folk might force strangers to separate and prove they aren't the tentacles of an illiceru.</p>\n<p>As an illiceru ages, so too do its puppets. Each puppet ages at a much faster rate than a human, growing from young adulthood to elderly every five years. When its puppets get too old, an illiceru enters a state of hibernation. The puppets fall off during this time, and new, younger puppets take their place. Occasionally, a baby illiceru will emerge from the decay of a discarded puppet and cling to its parent, who feeds it until it grows child-sized puppets of its own.</p>\n<h2>Dances With Illiceru</h2>\n<p>Those who are daring and quick on their feet may test whether two people are illiceru puppets by dancing with them, spinning and weaving until its tentacles get twisted in knots. Of course, plenty of people who aren't puppets are uncomfortable dancing with strangers, and a frustrated illiceru that thinks it is about to be exposed may choose to cut the shenanigans short with its jaws.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 175/390/720 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Athletics, Deception, Diplomacy, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> acid, bane, charisma, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), intelligence, mental, strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Jake Marohl","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":7},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":7}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"precise","range":60},{"type":"scent","acuity":"imprecise","range":120}],"vision":false},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":23,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":22},"deception":{"base":24},"diplomacy":{"base":22},"stealth":{"base":20}},"traits":{"value":["aberration","chaotic"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/illiceru.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Tremorsense  (Precise) 60 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Tremorsense]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tremorsense","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688685924407,"modifiedTime":1688685949394,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.j2wsK6IsW5yMW1jW","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"4uMhT4JP24HGQF18"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Scent (Imprecise) 120 feet","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Scent]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"scent","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688685929597,"modifiedTime":1688685961346,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.rqfnQ5VHT5hxm25r","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"vmSUg5HDzx5Dl8Dd"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Naturally Invisible","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The illiceru is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Invisible]{Invisible} at all times, though the human- like ends of its tentacles are always visible. Due to this, creatures that can't see the illiceru are not @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} to its tentacle Strikes. These tentacles can be targeted by Strikes and spells instead of the illiceru itself to avoid the flat check to target a @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Hidden]{Hidden} or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} creature, although the illiceru has a +2 circumstance bonus to its AC and Reflex saves when the target is a tentacle.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":["reflex","ac"],"value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["targeting-tentacles"]},{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"targeting-tentacles","toggleable":true,"label":"Targeting Tentacles","value":false}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"1HOULED4OqtYqNgc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688686065965,"modifiedTime":1691714301076,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Gluttonous Capture","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The illiceru's last action was a success with a tentacle Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The illiceru pulls the creature it hit into an adjacent space, then makes a jaws Strike against it. On a success, the illiceru then Grabs the target.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"JblGwg2G1M2eTeAN","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688686247410,"modifiedTime":1688686381168,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Plea for Help","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>One of the illiceru's tentacles cowers and begs for help, distracting and frightening a foe. The illiceru attempts a Deception check against a creature's Will DC. Regardless of the result of the check, the target is temporarily immune to this monster's Plea for Help for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 3} and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Off-Guard]{Off-Guard} to the illiceru's next tentacle Strike this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> As a critical success, except the target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"9V3l04bn6bKWkKUf","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688686247894,"modifiedTime":1688686412432,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Swallow Whole","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>